This repository bundles third-party content under site/library/ that is
NOT covered by the repository license. Each vendored skill keeps its own
LICENSE file next to its SKILL.md (Apache-2.0 and MIT at the time of
writing) and carries an `upstream:` block in its frontmatter naming the
source repository and path. Provenance tooling and the full upstream list
live in docs/UPSTREAMS.md. Content with no upstream stamp is original to
this library or of unknown origin; treat the latter as all-rights-reserved
by its author until attributed.

Prompts under site/library/4_Prompts/ come from public collections, one
top-level folder each:

- Awesome_ChatGPT/ derives from f/awesome-chatgpt-prompts, now
  f/prompts.chat (prompt data CC0 1.0).
- Fabric/ derives from danielmiessler/Fabric, data/patterns/*/system.md
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2012-2024 Scott Chacon and others).
- ChatGPT_Shortcut/ derives from rockbenben/ChatGPT-Shortcut,
