- ChatGPT_System_Prompts/ derives from mustvlad/ChatGPT-System-Prompts
  (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2023 Vlad Alexandru).
- Microsoft_Prompts_For_Edu/ derives from microsoft/prompts-for-edu
